    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Two-person studio founded by Antoine Enault and Ondine Vermenot, both from southern France; settled in Lisbon circa 2017. Ran for ~8 years before closing to new projects in January 2022. Specialized in creative direction, graphic design, identity systems, web design, and creative coding for fashion and culture clients. Their unique operating model had Ondine working days and Antoine nights, serving international clients across time zones. Antoine now runs an independent practice (antoineenault.fr); Ondine runs Studio OBV (studio-obv.com). Seniority: co-founder level, approximately director-equivalent, ~8 yrs of studio practice. Autonomy estimate: 4 (ran their own studio, self-directed, but a small two-person practice rather than a large independent creative force).",
      "source_url": null,
